{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFINALLOOP\u300b is a card building rougelike game\uff0cThe game uses real-time combat. Discover stronger combinations, build the strongest loops, and be prepared not to stop playing your cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic building: Hundreds of cards with different attributes and effects, constantly strengthen your deck, and use your battle gold to buy, upgrade, or remove your cards.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time combat: Fast-paced combat, a smooth poker experience, and plenty of time before each battle to think about how to deal with the enemy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random enemies: The enemies you encounter change every time you start a new game, and choose different strategies against different enemies.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357630?t=1754031894","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3357630?t=1754031894","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357630/0a1fbcfd7ec13dfd1c6455762e3e4c295888d348/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754031894","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3357630/0a1fbcfd7ec13dfd1c6455762e3e4c295888d348/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754031894","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3413880,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aFINALLOOP\u300b is a card building rougelike game\uff0cThe game uses real-time combat. Discover stronger combinations, build the strongest loops, and be prepared not to stop playing your cards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=